    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 65 Pic Du Jer Park is a truly special family home, beautifully maintained and thoughtfully extended over the years to create a warm, spacious and exceptionally comfortable residence in one of Cork’s most desirable and established residential locations. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers wonderfully versatile accommodation, with three reception rooms, beautifully appointed contemporary bathrooms and a superb principal bedroom suite. The current owners, now empty nesters, cleverly combined three of the original bedrooms to create a magnificent private suite, complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and luxurious ensuite. For those requiring four bedrooms, the wardrobe could readily be reconfigured to restore the fourth bedroom.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home are bright, light-filled interiors, beautifully presented in a sophisticated neutral palette. The accommodation is both elegant and practical, with a wonderful sense of space that makes the house equally suited to family life and entertaining. Outside, the property is complemented by a particularly peaceful, easy-maintenance south-facing rear garden – a private haven that enjoys excellent natural light throughout the day. To the front, off street parking is secured behind attractive cast-iron electric gates.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned on Ballinlough Road, No. 65 enjoys exceptional convenience, with an excellent range of schools, shops, cafés, sporting facilities and local amenities all close at hand, while Cork city centre is within easy reach. This is a home that combines space, style, comfort and an enviable location – a fabulous family property that has been lovingly cared for and is ready to be enjoyed by its next owners."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMODATION \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - Carpet floor covering. Understairs storage with light and a power outlet. \r\n\r\nSitting Room – Carpet floor covering. Feature shelving units with lighting. \r\n\r\nLounge room – with carpet floor covering. Interconnecting room with sitting room.  Feature display shelves with lighting incorporating a bioethanol fireplace. \r\n\r\nGuest WC with toilet and wash hand basin \r\n\r\nUtility Room – plumbed for washing machine and dryer machine. Gas boiler positioned here. Floor and eye level storage units. \r\n\r\nKitchen & Dining area – Tiled floor and splash back. Extensive eye and floor level kitchen units incorporating peninsula with high stool seating. Appliances include; eye level ovens, microwave, dishwasher American fridge freezer, electric hob and stainless steel extractor fan.  Double glass doors to sunroom.  \r\nDining area enjoys a bright position in front of a large window.  \r\n\r\nSunroom – an inviting reception room (with solid roof) Feature wall with shelving, fireplace and suitable for wall hung television.  Double doors to rear garden \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE: Perfectly positioned patio and deck areas surrounded by mature planting.  Timber shed, insulted and with electricity in use as a tool shed but suitable for easy conversion to a useable garden room. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR \r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs with feature lighting to the steps. \r\n\r\nFolding attic stairs to the attic, floored for light storage. \r\n\r\nBedroom One – carpet floor covering. Large double room, with walk in wardrobe (formally bedroom 4)\r\n \r\nEnsuite – tiled floor to ceiling with bath, separate shower, wash hand basin with vanity unit and toilet \r\n\r\nBedroom Two – double room with carpet floor covering and fitted sliderobes \r\n\r\nBedroom Three – double room with carpet floor covering and fitted wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBathroom – tiled floor to ceiling, with large shower (pumped) wc and wash hand basin with vanity"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Overall floor area approx.. 172sqm \r\n\r\nBER B \r\n\r\nPrivate South facing rear garden. \r\n\r\nExcellent condition throughout \r\n\r\nThree inviting reception rooms. \r\n\r\nEasily transferable from three to four bedrooms. \r\n\r\nWonderful location in the desirable address of Ballinlough"
      },
      {
